batch learning: you train with alot of data (offline system)

problem: if system learn about something , then it is not going to learn 
with new trend

you train data in offline and then upload it online

disadvantage: 
--> lots of data
--> hardware limit
--> availability (we dont have huge data) 



Online Machine Learning: 
--> you train data dynamically  with the new trend 
--> you do incremental learning , with small batches 
ex: Youtube( your feed get modified , after clicking on any vid)


when to use online ml: 
-> when there is rapid change in trend happens ( concept drift)
-> cost effective  (cheap hai ye)
-> faster solution (you train in mini batch and got faster and faster ) 


